// SKIP: prepare_path_challenge_frames: requires full frame encoding stack\n3308:        // SKIP: select_next_path_tuple: requires path readiness checks and pacing\n3317:        // SKIP: renew_connection_id: requires remote CID stash and tuple wiring\n3342:        // SKIP: retransmit_demoted_path: requires packet retransmit queue management\n3348:        // SKIP: queue_retransmit_on_ack: requires packet retransmit queue management\n3357:        // SKIP: delete_abandoned_paths: requires full path demotion lifecycle\n3472:        // SKIP: assign_peer_connection_id_to_tuple: requires remote CID stash wiring\n3804:        // SKIP: dereference_stashed_connection_id: requires path tuple CID dereferencing\n3815:        // SKIP: dereference_stashed_connection_id_tuple: requires retire CID frame queueing\n3890:        // SKIP: renew_path_connection_id: requires local CID retire frame queueing\n3906:        // SKIP: queue_for_retransmit: requires full retransmit queue management\n3922:        // SKIP: dequeue_retransmit_packet: requires full packet lifecycle management\n3933:        // SKIP: dequeue_retransmitted_packet: requires full packet lifecycle management\n3941:        // SKIP: reset: requires draining retransmit queues and reinitializing TLS\n4216:        // SKIP: refresh_quality_thresholds: threshold computation requires full path CC data\n4243:        // SKIP: issue_path_quality_update: requires callback infrastructure\n4252:        // SKIP: reinsert_by_wake_time: requires ConnectionToken to update the wake tree.\n4452:    // SKIP: parse_long_packet_type: needs version table; using V1 layout as default\n4883:    // SKIP: protect_packet_header: requires header protection crypto (TLS not yet wired)\n4902:        // SKIP: protect_packet: requires AEAD encryption (TLS not yet wired)\n4933:    // SKIP: remove_header_protection_inner: requires header protection crypto (TLS not yet wired)\n4964:        // SKIP: finalize_and_protect_packet_tuple: requires packet encryption\n4982:        // SKIP: finalize_and_protect_packet: requires packet encryption\n4988:        // SKIP: implicit_handshake_ack: requires handshake state machine\n4994:        // SKIP: false_start_transition: requires TLS handshake state\n5001:        // SKIP: client_almost_ready_transition: requires TLS handshake state\n5008:        // SKIP: ready_state_transition: requires full handshake completion logic\n5027:        // SKIP: parse_header_and_decrypt: requires full AEAD decryption stack (TLS not yet wired)\n5153:        // SKIP: select_ack_ranges: complex ACK range selection logic; needs full translation\n5204:        // SKIP: process_ack_of_ack_range: complex ack-of-ack logic\n5450:        // SKIP: packet ACK accounting — requires full packet-loss/RTT bookkeeping\n5477:        // SKIP: requires parse_ack_header (frame decode) — deferred to frame\n5492:        // SKIP: ACK-frequency computation — depends on congestion state and\n5499:        // SKIP: bandwidth seeding into CC — CC layer not yet wired in Phase 4.\n5505:        // SKIP: retransmit timer — requires RTT estimator and CC integration.\n5521:        // SKIP: RTT update — requires smoothed-RTT estimator and min-RTT tracking.\n5844:        // SKIP: full priority scheduling — return first output-stream candidate.\n5908:    // SKIP: stream frame decode — deferred to frame encode/decode phase.\n5921:    // SKIP: stream frame encode — deferred to frame encode/decode phase.\n5927:        // SKIP: MAX_STREAMS local update — deferred to transport-parameter phase.\n5944:        // SKIP: frame retransmit decision — requires frame-type parser and\n5960:    // SKIP: stream frame scheduling — deferred to frame encode/decode phase.\n5973:        // SKIP: data-repeat enqueue — requires Packet arena integration.\n5979:        // SKIP: data-repeat dequeue — requires Packet arena integration.\n5996:    // SKIP: stream frame copy for retransmit — deferred to frame encode/decode phase.\n6007:    // SKIP: retransmit stream fram