{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_18","type":"agent_message","text":"The first obvious signature problem is `get_stored_ticket(&self) -> Option<&mut StoredTicket>`: safe Rust cannot return a mutable borrow from an immutable receiver. I’ll avoid using that broken method as the main path and implement the working ticket/token APIs directly on `&mut self`, which is what the translated tests call."}}
